sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Alice
    participant B as Bob

    P ->> B: PEX_HELLO
    note right of B: { info_hash, self_addr,<br/>added: [peers], dropped: [] }
    B -->> P: PEX_HELLO
    note left of P: { info_hash, self_addr, added: [peers], dropped: [] }

    note over P,B: periodic exchange

    P ->> B: PEX_DELTA
    note right of B: { info_hash, added: [peers], dropped: [peers] }
    B -->> P: PEX_DELTA
    note left of P: { info_hash, added: [peers], dropped: [peers] }

    note over P,B: on disconnect

    P ->> B: PEX_DELTA
    note right of B: { info_hash, added: [], dropped: [self_addr] }
